ment andTechnology, Bill, 20251, as reported by the Standing Commiftee, be taken into consideration at once.(Amendments entered in a separate list to be moved)25. RANA MUHAMMAD QASIM NOON to move that the Bill to provide for theestablishment of Orbit lnstitute of Management and Technology [The Orbit Institute of Management andTechnology, Bill, 20251, be passed.
